	(text_box "IM68D121JV01XTMA1\n\nSynopsis:\n\n	Ultra-low power digital PDM XENSIV™ MEMS microphon\n\nDatasheet:\n\n	https://www.infineon.com/assets/row/public/documents/30/49/infineon-im68d121j-datasheet-en.pdf\n\nLR:\n\n	LR = GND, Data driven at falling clock edge. Data high-Z at rising edge.\n	LR = VDD, Data driven at rising clock edge. Data high-Z at falling edge.\n\nCurrent when CLK pulled low: \n	typ 1 uA max 5 uA\n\nOperating currents: \n	typical 580 uA: max 680 uA"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
